# exfil-hosts.list — known exfiltration sinks, tunnels and paste/drop hosts (contract §1.2).
#
# Columns: tier host. tier = lowest tier where the host applies (cumulative: 70 relaxed,
# 79 medium, 84 high at contract 1.0.0). host is lowercase with no scheme, port or trailing
# dot; *.x matches any subdomain of x and not x itself (x is listed separately).
# Records are sorted (LC_ALL=C) and unique.
#
# Seeded once (contract 1.0.0) from solanabr/solana-ai-kit .claude/bin/firewall.sh at kit
# commit 42755ab (the file last changed in 0ffd72b; RULE_SET_VERSION 7). From now on this file
# is the source: the kit vendors it (scripts/vendor-shared.sh) and deletes its own arrays.
# relaxed = DOMAINS_EXFIL_SINKS + DOMAINS_TUNNELS + DOMAINS_PASTE_AND_DROPS;
# medium = DOMAINS_MEDIUM; high = DOMAINS_HIGH.

